                    <p class="coating-kicker">The honest version</p>
                    <h2>Coating does not hide bad prep.</h2>
                    <p>Ceramic coating can deepen gloss, make routine washing easier, and add a durable sacrificial
                        layer over the finish. It does not erase scratches, stop rock chips, or make paint
                        maintenance-free.</p>
                    <p>That is why the conversation starts with the paint you have, not a package name. Some vehicles
                        need a careful decontamination and polish. Others need targeted paint correction before the
                        coating goes on.</p>
                </div>
                <figure class="coating-intro__image">
