                        <p>We review paint condition, prior care, problem areas, and the finish you want.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>02</span>
                        <h3>Decontaminate</h3>
                        <p>Thorough wash and surface preparation remove what should not be sealed beneath coating.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>03</span>
                        <h3>Correct</h3>
                        <p>Polishing or paint correction is matched to visible defects and the agreed scope.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>04</span>
                        <h3>Coat</h3>
                        <p>The prepared finish receives the coating, cure time, final inspection, and care guidance.</p>
                    </li>
                </ol>
